      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of perpetual misery is an incredibly heavy burden to carry, and the exhaustion of fighting a system that feels fundamentally against you is real. When the future looks like an endless loop of pain, stopping can feel like the only logical relief. Please, hold on for just a moment longer; there are people who want to listen to this unbearable weight. You can connect with support by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada.",
